	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Alfred workflow for quickly looking up the definition of a word in the Slovenian dictionary (SSKJ), its synonyms, and basic word data (word type, gender) from Sloleks.

Requires uv (https://docs.astral.sh/uv/), which installs Python and the dependencies on first run.

USAGE:
- sskj &lt;word&gt; – definitions (↩ copy, ⌥↩ open in browser)
- sinonim &lt;word&gt; – synonyms (↩ copy, ⌥↩ open in browser)
- podatki &lt;word&gt; – word type and gender (↩ copy, ⌥↩ open in browser)
- iskanje &lt;keyword&gt; – real-time word suggestions (↩ definitions, ⌘↩ synonyms, ⌃↩ word data, ⌥↩ open in browser)

e.g.
- iskanje kro
- sskj krog
- sinonim čas
- podatki krog

Data: fran.si (SSKJ², Sinonimni slovar) and viri.cjvt.si/sloleks.</string>
